description.narrative:
SALAR International AB (hereafter SALAR), a fully owned subsidiary of the Swedish Association of Local Authorities and Regions (hereafter SKR) contacted the Embassy of Sweden in 2020, regarding a potential Swedish support to the local governments and the decentralisation reform in Georgia. In 2022, SALAR approached the Embassy again, with a request to support a scoping mission that would be followed up by an inception phase in order to determine the ways forward and preparea  multy-year project in Georgia. 

The overall objective of the Project is:

The inception phase will determine ways forward with the aim to prepare for a multy-year project intervention in Georgia.

The specific objectives will include:

- To further define the thematic tracks of the project with a wider range of stakeholders and experts to assess the thematic areas and potential project ideas;

- To jointly with local stakeholders design and develop the theory of change and formulate the overall objectives of the project;

- To prepare the project implementation phase, build the project team and plan concrete activities;

- To establish strategic partnerships, select partners and define collaboration for anchorage and local ownership of the project results.
